{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14100","headline":"苦哉行五首 二 · 戎昱","name":"苦哉行五首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"官军收洛阳，家住洛阳里。\n夫壻与兄弟，目前见伤死。\n吞声不许哭，还遣衣罗绮。\n上马随匈奴，数秋黄尘里。\n生爲名家女，死作塞垣鬼。\n乡国无还期，天津哭流水。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14100.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14100","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}